{
  "$defs": {
    "ArticleManifest": {
      "description": "`article_manifests` 行的契约面（持久化形状）。\n\n`external_id` 与 `article_key` **不是一回事**（D-V3-01）：前者是渠道内幂等键\n（= `WorkListRow.id`，唯一约束 `(source_id, external_id)` 不变），后者是跨渠道的\n文章身份键（= `canonical_article_key(url)`，与 `content_assets.external_id` 同键空间）。\n`article_key` 列由 STEP-04 的迁移 `ab1006c1a` 引入，本契约先钉形状。",
      "properties": {
        "article_key": {
          "description": "= canonical_article_key(url)；新列 ab1006c1a",
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 3,
          "pattern": "^(?:b:[A-Za-z0-9+/=_-]{8,64}:[0-9]{1,12}:[0-9]{1,2}|s:[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,64}|h:[0-9a-f]{32})$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "content_hash": {
          "default": "",
          "maxLength": 64,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "external_id": {
          "description": "= WorkListRow.id（渠道内幂等键）",
          "maxLength": 128,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "id": {
          "maxLength": 36,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "publish_time": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null
        },
        "source_id": {
          "maxLength": 36,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "status": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ManifestStatus"
        },
        "title": {
          "maxLength": 512,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "url": {
          "maxLength": 512,
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "source_id",
        "external_id",
        "article_key",
        "url",
        "title",
        "status"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ChannelName": {
      "description": "发现渠道名，与 `registry.CHANNELS` 的键一一对应。\n\n新增渠道 = **契约变更**：这里加一个成员，`CHANNELS` 也得加一个 spec，两边由\n`tests/test_collection_contract.py` 钉住。比较口径（第一轮验证者指出我原来\"按顺序比较\"\n是错的耦合）：**与 `CHANNELS` 比集合**——dict 的插入序是实现细节，不该被契约依赖；\n**顺序只与冻结稿比**（`collection.schema.json` 的 enum 数组），那才是合同。\n数据库侧渠道字段仍是 `String(32)`（AGENTS.md 关键约束 3），本枚举只约束**契约面**。",
      "enum": [
        "redfox",
        "rss",
        "dajiala",
        "justoneapi",
        "tikhub",
        "wellbyte"
      ],
      "type": "string"
    },
    "CollectionEvent": {
      "description": "采集域内部事件（结构化日志 + 指标标签）。\n\n不是 outbox、不跨进程——别把它当持久化事件总线用。`idempotency_key` 是 page 级\n去重键 `{source_id}:{channel}:{yyyymmdd}:{page}`，告警按它一天一次。",
      "properties": {
        "at": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "channel": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ChannelName"
        },
        "count": {
          "default": 0,
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "event": {
          "enum": [
            "discovery.page_all_skipped",
            "discovery.id_fallback",
            "discovery.failed",
            "manifest.enqueued",
            "manifest.ingested",
            "manifest.failed",
            "manifest.stale_reverted"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        },
        "idempotency_key": {
          "default": "",
          "description": "page 级去重键 {source_id}:{channel}:{yyyymmdd}:{page}；告警按此键一天一次",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source_id": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "event",
        "source_id",
        "channel",
        "at"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "DiscoveryChannelView": {
      "description": "`GET /api/v1/admin/discovery/channels` 的 `data.channels[i]`。\n\n字段名是 **camelCase**（HTTP 响应体口径，实测锚 `registry.py:333-340`），\nPython 属性保持 snake_case + alias；`model_json_schema()` 默认按 alias 出属性名。\n三个布尔**刻意不合并**成一个 available：`implemented`（功能做没做）、`enabled`\n（配没配进白名单）、`available`（凭据在不在）合并后无法区分\"功能没做\"和\"功能没配\"，\n配置缺失会被伪装成渠道故障——这是 R7.6 的原话，留在这里免得后人\"顺手简化\"。",
      "properties": {
        "available": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "contractVerifiedAt": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "enabled": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "implemented": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "lastError": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "description": "STEP-05 新增（COULD）；不得含凭据或上游响应原文"
        },
        "lastSuccessAt": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "description": "STEP-05 新增（COULD）"
        },
        "name": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ChannelName"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "verifiedScope": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "name",
        "description",
        "implemented",
        "enabled",
        "available",
        "reason"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ManifestStatus": {
      "description": "清单行状态机（STEP-04 实现，受 D-V2-02）。\n\n合法迁移只有这几条，**枚举本身不校验迁移**——迁移表由 STEP-04 的服务层与测试承担：\n  DISCOVERED → ENQUEUED\n  ENQUEUED   → INGESTED | FAILED | DISCOVERED（仅 stale 回退：Job 终态而行仍 ENQUEUED）\n  FAILED     → DISCOVERED（仅人工/重试接口）\n其余迁移非法。",
      "enum": [
        "DISCOVERED",
        "ENQUEUED",
        "INGESTED",
        "FAILED"
      ],
      "type": "string"
    },
    "ManifestSyncReport": {
      "description": "单源单轮发现报告（`ManifestSyncService.sync_source` 返回值；日志/指标/告警共用）。\n\n两个计数有告警语义，不是普通整数：\n`id_fallback > 0` 记 WARNING（行缺 id、以规范键兜底，STEP-03.3.4）；\n`all_skipped_pages > 0` 记 ERROR + 告警（整页全跳 = 采集静默失败的形状，STEP-05）。",
      "properties": {
        "all_skipped_pages": {
          "default": 0,
          "description": "skipped == rows > 0 的页数；>0 记 ERROR + 告警",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "channel": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ChannelName"
        },
        "id_fallback": {
          "description": "行缺 id、以 canonical key 兜底的次数；>0 记 WARNING",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "new": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "pages": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "rows": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "skipped": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "unchanged": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "updated": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "channel",
        "pages",
        "rows",
        "new",
        "updated",
        "unchanged",
        "skipped",
        "id_fallback"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "WorkListPage": {
      "description": "发现分页壳（STEP-08 协议升级后启用；STEP-03 阶段 provider 仍返回 `list[WorkListRow]`）。\n\n`next_cursor` 是**必填可空**（冻结稿 `required: [rows, next_cursor, page_size]`）：\n\"到底了\"要显式写 `null`，不能靠缺字段表达——缺字段与\"末页\"在两方协议里是不同事实，\n混用会让上层把\"provider 忘了给游标\"读成\"已经没有下一页\"。",
      "properties": {
        "next_cursor": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "page_size": {
          "minimum": 1,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "rows": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/WorkListRow"
          },
          "type": "array"
        },
        "total": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "rows",
        "next_cursor",
        "page_size"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "WorkListRow": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "所有 provider `query_work_list` 的唯一输出形状。\n\n`extra=\"allow\"` 是有意的（冻结稿 `additionalProperties: true`）：渠道各自的上游字段\n差异很大，契约只钉\"三个必填 + 时间/正文的类型\"，其余透传。透传不等于无序扩张——\n新字段要被消费就得进契约，那时改这里。",
      "properties": {
        "author": {
          "default": "",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "digest": {
          "default": "",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "id": {
          "description": "上游稳定文章 id；上游无稳定 id 时 = canonical_article_key(url)",
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "publish_time": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "description": "provider 内即转为带时区时间；上游无时间才允许 null"
        },
        "title": {
          "maxLength": 512,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "url": {
          "format": "uri",
          "maxLength": 512,
          "minLength": 8,
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "url",
        "title"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
